{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning of the story, you awaken in a mysterious world with your memories lost, and the journey unfolds from there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, you must learn to survive \u2014 gathering food, collecting resources, and building a home. You can choose to survive alone or recruit villagers to establish a thriving tribe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the wilderness, you will encounter various monsters. Arm yourself with crafted gear, master magic, and defeat them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a vast journey, follow clues, and unravel the mystery of why you drifted here. Or, you can simply relax and enjoy the pastoral life. The choice is entirely yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay Highlights</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fishing \u2014 Cast into serene dream-ponds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gif]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunting and Gathering Resources \u2014 Provide for your survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gif]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cooking \u2014 Cook meals that heal and empower</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gif]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Homestead Building \u2014 Build your personal haven</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gif]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration and Treasure Hunting \u2014 Track down hidden riches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gif]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat Against Monsters \u2014 Face mystical creatures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gif]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Storyline \u2014 Unravel the deep mystery of this world and piece together your lost memories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Gif]</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3326670?t=1765991635","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326670/8452d43ac6c3a6a5b28c7a5d2e87c43248df4601/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765991635","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com